{"lines": ["How is Adam connected to The Rock?", "Raphael painted Adam in heaven above Pope Sixtus the Fourth in his Vatican fresco, the Disputa.", "Sixtus was the 212th pope, and the line runs down to the 264th, Pope John Paul the Second.", "In nineteen eighty, John Paul the Second welcomed a young senator, Joe Biden, and his wife Jill to the Vatican.", "Back in twenty twelve, Ash Carter of the Pentagon handed Vice President Biden a model armored truck.", "As Defense Secretary in twenty sixteen, Carter met comedian Kevin Hart backstage at Late Night with Seth Meyers.", "And in Berlin that year, Hart posed with his Central Intelligence co-star, The Rock.", "How is Benito Mussolini connected to Mario?", "In nineteen forty-one, Mussolini met Spain's dictator Francisco Franco on the Italian Riviera, pressing him to join the war.", "Spain stayed out, and in nineteen seventy-two Franco received California's governor, Ronald Reagan, in Madrid.", "In nineteen eighty-four, President Reagan met Arnold Schwarzenegger, fresh from The Terminator, at the Republican convention.", "In twenty twenty-five, Arnold brought his son-in-law, Chris Pratt, to the premiere of his show FUBAR.", "And in twenty twenty-three, Chris Pratt became the voice of Mario in the Super Mario Bros Movie.", "How is Queen Elizabeth the Second connected to Freddy Fazbear?", "In two thousand nine, Queen Elizabeth the Second welcomed Barack Obama to Buckingham Palace.", "In twenty fifteen, Obama was a guest on Jimmy Kimmel's late-night show.", "In twenty eighteen, Kimmel shared a Los Angeles stage with fellow host Conan O'Brien.", "At Comic-Con twenty fifteen, Conan hosted a Hunger Games panel with Josh Hutcherson.", "And in twenty twenty-three, Hutcherson played the night guard hunted by Freddy Fazbear in the Five Nights at Freddy's movie."], "heard": [["How", 0.0, 0.36], ["is", 0.36, 0.54], ["Adam", 0.54, 0.8], ["connected", 0.8, 1.3], ["to", 1.3, 1.7], ["the", 1.7, 1.8], ["rock?", 1.8, 2.08], ["Raphael", 3.